From: Paul Sajna <hello@paulsajna.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Mar 2025 21:11:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] arch: arm64: configs: sdm845: enable LG SW49410 panel driver

Signed-off-by: Paul Sajna <hello@paulsajna.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0ea216277ccb828f9f847e708efb744781e24e89)
Link: https://gitlab.com/sdm845-mainline
Signed-off-by: Richard Acayan <mailingradian@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config b/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config
index 0a6e82b..4a25cd7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/sdm845.config
@@ -69,6 +69,9 @@ CONFIG_I2C_HID_OF_ELAN=m
 CONFIG_BACKLIGHT_PWM=y
 CONFIG_LENOVO_YOGA_C630_EC=m
 
+# LG Judyln
+CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_LG_SW49410=y
+
 # SOC
 CONFIG_FORCE_NR_CPUS=y
 CONFIG_NR_CPUS=8
